  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.2\n\n\t\t\t- **Enhancement:** Added `ClaimsPrincipalExtensions.GetUserId()` to simplify extracting the user ID from JWT claims.\n\t\t\t- **Enhancement:** Updated `AuthorizationFilter` to use the new extension method, allowing optional fallback to the `AuthorizeResourceAttribute.UserId` if the claim is missing.\n\t\t\t- **Improvement:** Makes user ID resolution more robust and reduces hard-coded dependencies.\n\t\t\t- **Refactor:** Cleaner and more maintainable authorization filter logic.\n\t\t\t- **Backwards Compatible:** Existing usage with `AuthorizeResourceAttribute.UserId` continues to work.",
